#Organism_modal<[
Базис:
  Gripe `<x-ui.organisms.modal>` — teleport overlay, body scroll lock, mobile scroll body.
  AN-21 atoms/modal.bvc was atom layer mismatch; organism is canonical in Gripe.
Вектор:
  Props: name, title, maxWidthClass, closeOnOverlay, showCloseButton, contentPadding.
  WG vanilla: no Alpine; static open/close for ui-kit + future confirm flows.
Цель:
  Organism modal contract aligned with Gripe DS (not OneBase).

Проверки:
  data-testid=ui-modal-organism
  panel uses --ui-radius-modal

Метки:
  atom.profile: ui_component
  ui.layer: organism
  ui.id: modal
  ui.marketplace.blade: resources/views/components/ui/organisms/modal.blade.php
  ui.workgraph.module: src/ui/organisms/modal.mjs
  trace.status: verified
